### IndexTTS API Test Cases

## Health Check
GET http://localhost:18000/health

###

## Get Model Info
GET http://localhost:18000/info

###

## Upload Speaker Reference Audio
POST http://localhost:18000/upload
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="speaker_reference.wav"
Content-Type: audio/wav

< ./examples/voice_01.wav
--boundary--

###

## Upload Emotion Reference Audio
POST http://localhost:18000/upload
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="emotion_reference.wav"
Content-Type: audio/wav

< ./examples/emo_sad.wav
--boundary--

###

## List Uploaded Files
GET http://localhost:18000/list

###

## TTS Synthesis - Basic Voice Cloning
POST http://localhost:18000/tts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "spk_audio_prompt": "abcd1234.wav",
  "text": "Hello, this is a cloned voice demonstration."
}

###

## TTS Synthesis - With Emotion Audio Prompt
POST http://localhost:18000/tts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "spk_audio_prompt": "abcd1234.wav",
  "emo_audio_prompt": "efgh5678.wav",
  "emo_alpha": 0.9,
  "text": "This speech has emotional influence from the prompt."
}

###

## TTS Synthesis - With Emotion Vector
POST http://localhost:18000/tts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "spk_audio_prompt": "abcd1234.wav",
  "emo_vector": [0, 0, 0.5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0],
  "text": "This speech expresses sadness as indicated by the emotion vector."
}

###

## TTS Synthesis - Text-Based Emotion Control
POST http://localhost:18000/tts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "spk_audio_prompt": "abcd1234.wav",
  "use_emo_text": true,
  "emo_text": "This person is very excited and happy",
  "emo_alpha": 0.6,
  "text": "I am so thrilled about this amazing opportunity!"
}

###

## TTS Synthesis - Advanced Parameters
POST http://localhost:18000/tts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "spk_audio_prompt": "abcd1234.wav",
  "text": "Advanced parameter control example",
  "temperature": 0.9,
  "top_p": 0.9,
  "do_sample": true
}

###

## TTS Synthesis - Random Sampling
POST http://localhost:18000/tts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "spk_audio_prompt": "abcd1234.wav",
  "use_random": true,
  "temperature": 1.0,
  "text": "This synthesis uses random sampling for variation."
}